{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You woke up inside an unfamiliar elevator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this apartment building, you must observe your surroundings carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graffiti inside the elevator, notes stuck to the walls, building notices...<br><strong>Everything could be a clue. Pay close attention to every detail.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone\u2014or something\u2014may try to stop you from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But don't worry.</strong><br>There are those who genuinely want to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you'll be able to successfully complete your <strong>Eviction Request Form</strong> and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ExitApartment</strong> is a game inspired by cosmic horror, Japanese &quot;Napolitan&quot; urban legends, dreamcore, and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than relying on traditional horror or monsters, we focused on evoking fear and unease through bizarre situations and unsettling environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30\u201360 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Option</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse sensitivity, sound volume, brightness, and language settings can be adjusted in the game options.<br><strong>We recommend setting the brightness before starting the game</strong> for the best experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Glutton for Punishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888790/17c28eb41a103890628d82798c6544385ec270b4.jpg"},{"name":"You Got Baited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co