 those who genuinely want to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you'll be able to successfully complete your <strong>Eviction Request Form</strong> and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ExitApartment</strong> is a game inspired by cosmic horror, Japanese &quot;Napolitan&quot; urban legends, dreamcore, and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than relying on traditional horror or monsters, we focused on evoking fear and unease through bizarre situations and unsettling environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30\u201360 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Option</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse sensitivity, sound volume, brightness, and language settings can be adjusted in the game options.<br><strong>We recommend setting the brightness before starting the game</strong> for the best experience.</p>","developers":["Joseph"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888790/571125764bd9f82edb8c0bbc135ef47044e4a2c3/header.jpg?t=1755260575","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888790/875850912/480058ee6b8adc49398eb318dd209ac2d48f5f17/1752771264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753255543","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888790/875850912/480058ee6b8adc49398eb318dd209ac2d48f5f17/1752771264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753255543","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3888790/875850912/480058ee6b8adc49398eb318dd209ac2d48f5f17/1752771264/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753255543","id":257170378,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.